        {
          "path": "_m/u/s/6/g/kevo-strict-nature-reserve-wk/kevo-big-stone.jpg",
          "filename": "Kevo big stone.jpg",
          "caption": "A glacial erratic by the Kevo hiking trail inside Kevo Strict Nature Reserve. This stone is marked on the map, mentioned on the trail description, and it lies on the slope of Geavvogeašoaivi fell at the highest place on this trail, slightly more than 400 m.a.sl. This is well above the treeline. Notice how the trekking trail has eroded to the ground. Inside the Strict Nature Reserve one is not allowed to move any stones but some people do it anyways.",
          "alt": "A glacial erratic by the Kevo hiking trail inside Kevo Strict Nature Reserve. This stone is marked on the map, mentioned on the trail description, and it lies on the slope of Geavvogeašoaivi fell at the highest place on this trail, slightly more than 400 m.a.sl. This is well above the treeline. Notice how the trekking trail has eroded to the ground. Inside the Strict Nature Reserve one is not allowed to move any stones but some people do it anyways.",
          "width": 4608,
          "height": 3456,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
